  "text": "2026 Annual Conference\nSearch\nMember Login\nHome\nAbout\nExecutive Committee\nTACRAO Committees\nHistory of TACRAO\nAffliated / Partner Organizations\nEvents\nAnnual Conference\nAnnual Conference 2026\nLeadership Workshop\nSEM Workshop\n2026 Sponsors & Exhibitors\nConference Charitable Partner\nExciting Door Prizes\nFacilitator Guidelines\n2021  & Forward Annual Conference Presentations\nSummer Meetings\nTACRAO College Fair Schedule\nTexas Swing Recruiting Calendar\nFuture TACRAO Meetings\nTCCNS Update Webinar\nGet Involved\nMembership\nTACRAO Membership\nAffiliate Membership\nTACRAO College Fair Subscription\nIntra-State Regional Associations\nHonorary Members\nTACRAO Listserv\nFAQs\nTACRAO Historical Awards\nResources\nGoverning Documents\nReports\nStanding Committee Reports\nOfficial Correspondence\nStandards and Guidelines\nTax Documents\nWebinar Recordings\nDiscussion Forum Information\nNews & Announcements\nNewsletters\nJob Board\nJob Board FAQs\nSearch\nMember Login\nHome\nAbout\nExecutive Committee\nTACRAO Committees\nHistory of TACRAO\nAffliated / Partner Organizations\nEvents\nAnnual Conference\nAnnual Conference 2026\nLeadership Workshop\nSEM Workshop\n2026 Sponsors & Exhibitors\nConference Charitable Partner\nExciting Door Prizes\nFacilitator Guidelines\n2021  & Forward Annual Conference Presentations\nSummer Meetings\nTACRAO College Fair Schedule\nTexas Swing Recruiting Calendar\nFuture TACRAO Meetings\nTCCNS Update Webinar\nGet Involved\nMembership\nTACRAO Membership\nAffiliate Membership\nTACRAO College Fair Subscription\nIntra-State Regional Associations\nHonorary Members\nTACRAO Listserv\nFAQs\nTACRAO Historical Awards\nResources\nGoverning Documents\nReports\nStanding Committee Reports\nOfficial Correspondence\nStandards and Guidelines\nTax Documents\nWebinar Recordings\nDiscussion Forum Information\nNews & Announcements\nNewsletters\nJob Board\nJob Board FAQs\nAnnual Conference\nLocation\nThe Annual Conference will be held at Houston’s beautiful\nWestin Galleria\nand\nWestin Oaks\n, with primary events taking place at the Westin Galleria.\nThe venue offers convenient access to dining and shopping, as it is connected to the Galleria Mall.\nAgenda-at-a-Glance\nHotel Accommodations\nThe deadline to book a room within the TACRAO hotel room block has passed for The Westin Galleria Houston and The Westin Oaks Houston at the Galleria.\nAttendees who still need accommodations are encouraged to contact the hotels directly to inquire about any remaining availability.\nHotel Websites:\nThe Westin Galleria Houston\nThe Westin Oaks Houston at the Galleria\nYou may also reach out to the LAC Co-Chairs for additional information or assistance with accommodations.\nRegistration\nREGISTER HERE\nRegular registration will continue through\nFriday, September 25, 2026\n.\nLate registration will begin on\nSaturday, September 26, 2026\n.\nSee the\nfee schedule\nfor the registration fees.\nThe deadline to request a refund is\nFriday, September 25, 2026.\nAny registration remaining after this date will be the responsibility of the registrant and their institution.\nNeed to demonstrate the value of TACRAO Conference attendance to your supervisor?  Utilize our\nletter template\nto assist you.\nWhat to Expect\nPlease check back regularly for the latest updates!\nAttendees can look forward to a full schedule of sessions, networking opportunities, and social events.\nNew for 2026!\nLeadership Workshop\nLed by Danny Canary\nSEM Workshop\nLed by Sylvia Ewell\nKeynote Speaker\nWelcome Holly Rowe!\nConference Charitable Partner:\nFind out more and donate\nSponsors & Exhibitors\nExciting Door Prizes\nSponsorship Opportunities\nSearch\nMember Login\nLatest Job Postings\nQuick Links\nAnnual Conference\nExecutive Committee\nVolunteer Interest Form\nTACRAO Newsletters\nTexas Common Course Numbering System (TCCNS)\nTACRAO College Fair Schedule\nInstitutional Member Directory Search\nLatest News\nFall 2026 Newsletter\nUpcoming Events\nSun Nov 7, 2027\n2027 Annual Conference TACRAO\nCategory: Annual Conference\nView Full Calendar\nTexas Association of Collegiate Registrars and Admissions Officers (TACRAO)\n4400 State Hwy 121 Suite 300 #1225\nLewisville, TX 75056\nKey Contacts\nMembership/Subscription:\nTiffany Lipscomb\n,\nTACRAO Secretary\nCollege Day/Night Recruiting Program:\nSierra Trenhaile\n, Chair-High School Relations Committee\nWebsite:\nJodie Rexroat\n, VP Technology\nAll Other Association Issues:\nLori Zerr\n, TACRAO President\nFacebook\nTwitter\nInstagram\nBack to top\npowered by\nMemberClicks",
